{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-five-jumeriah-village","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"five-jumeriah-village-fmi-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Five Jumeirah Village is a luxury project by developer FMI, located in the Jumeirah Village Circle neighborhood. The development is an elegant 60-storey building that offers luxury living in the heart of one of the most picturesque and developing areas of Dubai.Five Jumeirah Village offers a wide range of studios, 1,2 &amp; 4 bedroom apartments with sophisticated design and modern amenities.Residents can enjoy spacious floor plans, panoramic city and ocean views, and access to luxurious public areas and amenities that include a swimming pool, gym, spa, children's play and development areas and fine dining restaurants. The complex also offers unique services and activities such as exclusive access to the beach club at Palm Jumeirah Beach, concierge service, VIP treatment and various activities for residents.Five Jumeirah Village stands out not only for its luxurious execution and unique design, but also for its attractive location surrounded by nature and state-of-the-art infrastructure. Thanks to the strategic location of the complex, residents can quickly reach the main attractions of the city. Palm Jumeirah and Dubai Marina are just 15 minutes away by car, while Burj Al Arab, The Walk JBR, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are within a radius of 20 - 25 minutes.The complex will be an ideal choice for those looking for comfortable and stylish living in one of Dubai's fastest growing neighborhoods.","price":1499000,"title":"Five Jumeriah Village","bitrix":{"id":661,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Five Jumeriah Village","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Five Jumeriah Village","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Five Holdings","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h